{"title":"Old Graytusk","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Old Graytusk is a named <a href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull\">Mammoth Bull</a> seen at level 54.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Old Graytusk</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 357, -853</li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"old-graytusk\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mothsilk-feet\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/e324bfa37a4979ed76fa.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mothsilk Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/c09cd248cb6e3a2e20a2.svg\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Old Graytusk</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull\">Mammoth Bull</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>54</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>1,074</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>3 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}